{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:18:200","content":{"id":200,"title":"第二十课：光场、颜色与感知","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e4f0042b-c1f8-4f88-94f1-f1bc374992cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从看到的世界是什么说起，设置一个简单场景，看屋子以及透过屋子还可以看到树，把看到的东西画下来。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15ca16e7-5ea5-4965-b590-f2c7ae44ba8c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果在这个房间加一个幕布，这个幕布可以完美反映你看到的图，你看这个幕布和看真实世界没有区别，这就是虚拟现实的原理。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"90ddf71a-19f5-4720-a660-db82f862fb6a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大家看到的只有光线，不知道多远。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6adad60b-9f91-4d95-bc6d-9968ed93570e.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"08a84f6d-fdf3-46ad-ab28-3da4083cb00f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_788f18b4-cb5d-4c37-bff0-f8c0fb62cb58.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"2cc444e7-ad4f-4e66-b817-b766b61028ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"24f6bbf3-94b9-42ed-8514-366c7553d1f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"描述人到底可以看到什么东西，用一个全光函数，全光函数是什么？能看到的所有东西。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_678cac8f-d905-4709-a863-d259c770028d.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"1a4e9160-e0a3-4afd-badc-6960e570e98e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4ae85242-e74e-4609-a438-40f27475801a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最简单的全光函数，在一个场景里，位置固定，往四面八方看，对人与任意一个方向，可以看到一个什么值"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e8061ea4-d946-4e27-a6a5-d16c5587d5eb.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"14b118b5-c7b5-4d76-b0ca-3717e6c88281","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1551ecc9-0982-4e12-82ef-31d20b8b8fe2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"改进，引入波长（引入了各种颜色）"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ce6f3515-6ee1-4031-bc6d-1b8b45af66fa.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"29842749-e321-4532-b01c-b6baef148699","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"03fb5971-ebc2-44d7-b575-15ca61e437ff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"进一步扩展，引入时间，这就是电影"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bb44f221-e693-437b-af45-2f5a5118e370.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"70619a1d-df0f-40e7-acf2-56249d50289a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cd49bbfa-ed6f-4968-bd8d-823103040dcb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"进一步扩展，人站的位置固定，现在考虑人的位置在三维空间任意一个位置，看到的是什么，全息电影"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ccf68f3e-df81-4ea9-9031-ba4874c652b8.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"6b7e0c90-d12d-4839-b556-f2efde83dc2a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f2170c76-6758-4f4a-9a6f-73d14e0c6800","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在改进一步，理解为在任何位置，往任何方向看，在任何时间，看到的不同颜色，这就是看到的世界"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4c92b567-ae85-4412-9b2d-8e485245b692.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"550a1b73-1086-4a59-9cb0-ab37b1cb11c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5fe6ee92-2eeb-4cee-98af-cdad59c7a76b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以从全光函数提取一部分信息，表示更复杂的光，所谓光场就是全光函数的一个小部分。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"294e0f2b-7c51-4ec9-8618-a3c18482dc84","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"定义光线，三维空间空的任意一条光线"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e7e13f46-1e73-4b8a-a1c5-58e59df2ce39.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c59fce66-ac34-46ac-b8ec-d05b917335e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"672867a3-7aa4-4248-ad8e-a2937d669d78","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"取光线上任意两点就可以定义一条光线，定义一条光线只要二维的位置和二维的方向"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_255344e3-0100-449e-9313-42757d236af8.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"6e2e93db-8328-4866-92e7-4a79fba6f25e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"88541e27-a369-4aa7-9944-5550533bfa8f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光场（Light Field） 是描述光在空间中传播方向和位置信息的完整数据集。它记录了光线在三维空间中每一点的"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"方向"},{"type":"formatted","text":"和"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"强度"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，相当于用更高维度的数据来表征光的分布。与传统成像（仅记录投影到传感器上的光线强度）不同，光场能捕捉光线的"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"全向信息。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a8e577dc-76b2-4078-9452-37ddc2411c7b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"想象用无数微型摄像头从不同角度拍摄同一场景，再将所有数据融合成一个可交互的光线数据库。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1db578e6-161d-4559-8418-efb64570b3b7.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"fb05f640-980b-417e-99e3-277d4aa48b56","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"47027386-7aa7-42ce-b834-6b025beebef2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有了物体的光场，从任意一个位置从物体看，都可以知道看到物体什么，可以得到任意物体的一个不同的观测"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_360b47e8-2a63-4444-8b3a-73e152176f94.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"2b256c76-f59c-4864-9c0d-c4bf0ea7503c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e153621a-0f47-406d-802e-fdc2ec44ed90","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光场定义在物体表面，不需要知道光场表示的是什么，我只关心表面到观测点的能量是多少"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5a2de97b-568d-4e13-874a-a5b6db1b5834.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f0031f0d-6239-41c5-abdb-300554bdbcb1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5ff4bad-8638-4f0d-918a-9cb5e24325f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种方式可以理解为取一个平面，平面的右边是发光物体，可以忽略，我只关心平面左边是什么"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_221c8f08-c968-4af8-b3d4-9e6e18876ffc.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"5ff5cd57-f734-41a3-b702-b5c870d7479e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6f8564dc-1e6d-4a20-b182-120a8726ad3f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"是不是说，对于任意光场，可以用两个平面定义一个光场，两个点定义光线，光场是一个四维函数，这是一种描述的方式"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a6eca2b1-63b0-440a-97b5-972b42651d9f.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"8ace6757-f6e8-4442-9239-3fb7e2b0d670","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"89be1afd-8802-4b6d-9f45-181f317acbdd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以有不同的理解方式，"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5d7048a1-befc-4d34-b7c9-e7c2cbca004c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从 uv 上取固定一个点，看向所有 st 平面，会看到什么，会看到完整的物体的图。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_29e7dd74-4632-4725-aa15-38ac0e751a47.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c7a8e85d-1505-4011-be21-72882d5182b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a91d110c-5133-4a12-8d69-196cae44ec9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 st 固定一个点，看 uv 长什么样，等价于反过来，从 uv 各个点看向 st 同一个点，可以看到同一个物体不同方向是什么"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_fe59a421-b573-44fb-8524-a9445e5e4239.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"d186217d-7551-42a4-aaf4-5ff2c539d5e3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"65848888-1059-4709-8fb8-e989f41fb0ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"斯坦福做的摄像机的矩阵，12 * 8，相当于在不同的位置对场景拍不同的图，每一个位置就是 uv，拍到的就是 st，最后得到一个光场"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dd5f998c-29a6-4d2a-980b-6c2e2355e17d.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f5f23a88-a6af-42f1-8c4c-4d9bdc807b87","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b373d1a-4b14-404e-ae5d-d1ac30d85c61","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外一种，在自然界，苍蝇，复眼，呈现的就是光场，有一个透镜，把各个方向的光分到不同的地方，就可以把不同方向的光记录到不同的位置"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2e39003f-a1ff-4acf-a5a1-1d7d3d53c87c.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"8c892a88-c6d3-442c-a292-3956dc45f4ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"87b92152-4208-4135-b5dc-81f23f86ab2b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光场照相机，Ren Ng，创立了公司，Lytro Light Field Camera，原理就是微透镜原理，把像素替换为透镜，把不同方向的光区分开，有什么功能，支持后期的聚焦，动态调节虚拟的焦距，先拍照，在调。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2a2c1c89-6c10-430f-94d0-703dd7c6bc95.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"59d1c63a-7e54-45e1-865b-3097c8c6b1ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"473a6a77-7f99-42ce-be09-f09ebfe096bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光场照相机的原理，就是光场的原理。在以前普通的相机里，把像素换成了微透镜，微透镜把不同方向的光分散到不同地方，然后感光元件记录下来，以前记录一个像素，现在记录一块像素"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d4c3054e-e43f-419b-892b-31c36e979df9.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"ce1b01b5-ba92-40ce-9e8c-810ad7aed7e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a581a0a-b81c-4e92-83e3-f3f565d47607","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"拍的光场的图，怎么还原成普通的照片，把每一个透镜的光线的方向选一条，把结果记录在一个像素上。去不同方向的光线，就好像在移动照相机的位置。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b6347c40-1ab6-4a64-aece-12f88b9390ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重新聚焦是同样的道理，在重新聚焦的过程中知道光场的变化，可以算出来查哪个方向的光线，按需取即可"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"51fe8e09-f80b-4005-b1b0-c5b2d469ce61","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这一切是因为记录了光场的信息"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_778d7aa9-2e89-483b-b4f5-b1cbc408078c.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"b91b151f-0ca8-4ded-93be-1bf842b340b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"daaf408f-9b69-4746-871a-3add75c08b1d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光场摄像机有什么问题？光场摄像机分辨率不足，一个小块对应一个像素的信息，假设是 10 * 10，要用 100 个像素记录原来一个像素的信息，对胶片的分辨率要求很高，成本高。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a7dbff2d-7829-4dd5-87ac-89858364147c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于微透镜实现起来非常复杂，成本也很高。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"65ff29b0-7356-409c-a905-7f76f257324a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"计算机图形学是关于各种方面的权衡。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_23a0187d-127c-4c86-b674-be327fd4ff71.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"5be12603-10ce-4802-a528-c81cc6ba26ff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"181c69b5-fbc1-4b53-8b65-727120c50f25","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ee2c1fe-a798-4165-99a8-ca3f8eaffed7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"颜色到底是什么，在早期，牛顿做的实现，光线经过棱镜形成了彩虹的颜色，不同的颜色可以合成其他颜色"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4961e9a4-da60-4ab4-b99b-b5823e3028ac.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"95f3fbe2-4cc5-4bf1-8df6-3685e78726fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph",